From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mmis1000 <mmis10002@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 17:40:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Terminal menus: lifetime items only where they change
 something, and Detach

Make Persistent shows only for window-owned targets and Make Window-owned only
for persistent ones, in the panel tab menus (keys set from the menu's
terminals when it opens), the terminal editor tab menu (resource in the
persistent / window-owned resource lists) and the command palette (active
terminal's lifetime). Detach Session is added to both tab menus and, like the
lifetime commands, acts on the terminal the menu was opened on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
